		<title>BlackSky Acquires Data Science Firm EpochGeo</title>
		<link>https://payloadspace.com/blacksky-acquires-data-science-firm-epochgeo/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Victoria Woodburn]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Business]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[BlackSky]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://payloadspace.com/?p=33829</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="200" height="200" src="https://payloadspace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BlackSky_Fifth_Gen-3_First_Light_China_Nanning_20260912-0725-local-200x200.png" class="attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Satellite image captured hours after launch by BlackSky’s fifth Gen-3 satellite. Image: BlackSky" decoding="async" srcset="https://payloadspace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BlackSky_Fifth_Gen-3_First_Light_China_Nanning_20260912-0725-local-200x200.png 200w, https://payloadspace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BlackSky_Fifth_Gen-3_First_Light_China_Nanning_20260912-0725-local-150x150.png 150w, https://payloadspace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BlackSky_Fifth_Gen-3_First_Light_China_Nanning_20260912-0725-local-70x70.png 70w" sizes="(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px" />BlackSky ($BKSY) announced its acquisition of geospatial data science firm EpochGeo yesterday, which will merge EpochGeo’s AI/ML capabilities with BlackSky’s existing constellation and analytics tools.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://payloadspace.com/blacksky-acquires-data-science-firm-epochgeo/" data-wpel-link="internal">BlackSky Acquires Data Science Firm EpochGeo</a> appeared first on <a href="https://payloadspace.com" data-wpel-link="internal">Payload</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										
					
		
		
