					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="200" height="200" src="https://payloadspace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/NEW-ARROW450_web-uai-1440x810-1-200x200.jpg" class="attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Render of ARROW 450 satellite. Image: Airbus US Space &amp; Defense" decoding="async" srcset="https://payloadspace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/NEW-ARROW450_web-uai-1440x810-1-200x200.jpg 200w, https://payloadspace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/NEW-ARROW450_web-uai-1440x810-1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://payloadspace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/NEW-ARROW450_web-uai-1440x810-1-70x70.jpg 70w" sizes="(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px" />Cerberus Capital Management is acquiring the US space systems business of Airbus US Space &#038; Defense, the investment firm announced Tuesday.</p>
